  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "2. Arrange tostadas on a baking sheet.",
    "3. Bake for 5-7 minutes, or until crispy.",
    "4. In a medium bowl, whisk together sugar, red chili flakes, lime juice, and fish sauce.",
    "5. Add diced cucumber, carrot, red onion, and cilantro to the bowl.",
    "6. Toss to combine, then season with salt to taste.",
    "7. To assemble the tostadas, spread a spoonful of the spicy sauce on each crispy tostada.",
    "8. Top with additional cilantro and serve immediately."
